WEBVTT

00:04.710 --> 00:05.730
I knew it...

00:05.730 --> 00:06.440
It's coming!

00:07.070 --> 00:08.570
The Female Titan!

00:14.560 --> 00:17.120
The Female Titan emerged once more,

00:17.120 --> 00:21.100
defeating the elite Squad Levi members, 
one after the next.

00:27.440 --> 00:28.510
I will kill it!

00:28.840 --> 00:33.340
Having decided it was his fault for 
believing in his companions,

00:33.340 --> 00:35.530
Eren transforms and engages 
the Female Titan.

00:38.330 --> 00:43.350
but he suffers defeat, and the 
Female Titan takes him.

00:48.510 --> 00:52.220
Give Eren back!

01:03.400 --> 01:07.130
No matter where she goes, I'll kill her,

01:07.130 --> 01:09.390
rip her apart,

01:09.390 --> 01:12.800
and get you out of that filth.

01:13.730 --> 01:15.110
I'm sorry, Eren...

01:15.890 --> 01:17.250
Just wait a little longer...

01:26.860 --> 01:27.850
Wait!

01:28.520 --> 01:29.770
Wh-What are you...

01:32.200 --> 01:33.480
Fall back for now.

03:09.960 --> 03:14.960
The Defeated 
57th Expedition Beyond the Walls (6)

03:18.970 --> 03:20.530
Maintain this distance.

03:21.320 --> 03:22.810
It may be tired.

03:22.810 --> 03:24.930
It does not appear to 
be going very fast.

03:25.800 --> 03:28.160
He seems to have been bitten 
right out of the neck.

03:28.670 --> 03:30.060
Is Eren dead?

03:33.230 --> 03:34.360
He's alive.

03:34.760 --> 03:37.210
The target appears intelligent,

03:37.210 --> 03:39.690
and its goal seems to be capturing Eren.

03:40.350 --> 03:42.330
If it wanted him dead, 
it would've crushed him.

03:43.740 --> 03:46.200
The target is fighting to 
escape after going through

03:46.200 --> 03:47.910
the trouble of putting him in its mouth.

03:49.280 --> 03:51.540
Its goal may have been to eat Eren.

03:51.830 --> 03:54.040
If that's the case, he's in its stomach.

03:54.620 --> 03:56.750
It's more reasonable to 
assume that he's dead.

03:56.750 --> 03:58.050
He's alive!

04:00.340 --> 04:01.700
I hope you're right.

04:03.590 --> 04:08.390
If you'd only protected Eren, 
this wouldn't have happened!

04:11.940 --> 04:13.280
I see...

04:13.280 --> 04:14.790
You're the one from back then.

04:15.680 --> 04:17.140
Eren's close friend?

04:20.060 --> 04:21.960
We'll limit ourselves to a single goal.

04:22.670 --> 04:25.720
First, give up on killing 
the Female Titan.

04:25.720 --> 04:28.660
It killed many of our comrades!

04:29.390 --> 04:32.430
As long as it can harden 
its skin, we can't kill it.

04:32.870 --> 04:34.160
Do as I say.

04:35.060 --> 04:38.440
We'll pin our hopes on 
Eren still being alive,

04:38.440 --> 04:40.770
and rescue him before 
it leaves the forest.

04:41.250 --> 04:42.800
I will tear away at it...

04:42.800 --> 04:44.550
You draw its attention!

05:44.020 --> 05:45.010
He's fast...

05:45.010 --> 05:47.530
So fast that it has no 
time to harden its skin!

06:01.140 --> 06:03.320
We can go for the neck...

06:03.900 --> 06:04.980
It's tired...

06:04.980 --> 06:06.260
I bet it can't move!

06:06.810 --> 06:07.930
I can kill it!

06:11.570 --> 06:12.300
Stop!

06:27.500 --> 06:28.280
Eren!

06:35.410 --> 06:36.040
Hey!

06:37.590 --> 06:38.830
We're getting out of here!

06:39.100 --> 06:40.140
Eren...

06:42.020 --> 06:43.190
I think he's okay...

06:43.190 --> 06:44.020
He's alive!

06:44.360 --> 06:45.500
But filthy.

06:46.150 --> 06:47.820
Forget about it...

06:48.280 --> 06:49.280
We'll retreat.

06:50.720 --> 06:53.070
Don't lose sight of the core objective.

06:53.800 --> 06:56.780
Is it more important 
to get what you want?

06:57.540 --> 06:59.770
Isn't he an important friend?

07:02.700 --> 07:05.270
No, I...

07:23.170 --> 07:24.840
They're already coming back?

07:26.100 --> 07:27.570
What happened?

07:27.570 --> 07:28.900
No idea...

07:29.360 --> 07:32.970
But I bet they're bringing plenty 
of dead bodies with them again.

07:48.930 --> 07:51.120
Eldo is coming home.

07:55.600 --> 07:56.680
I see.

07:59.170 --> 08:02.410
Think Oluo will have time to come home?

08:03.300 --> 08:06.210
It wouldn't hurt to make 
him dinner, just in case.

08:10.890 --> 08:12.840
Gunther's coming back.

08:17.390 --> 08:18.480
I see.

09:19.790 --> 09:21.830
This is the part I never get used to.

09:23.250 --> 09:24.880
No one does.

09:26.460 --> 09:29.020
How are my friends going to die?

09:29.800 --> 09:31.510
How am I going to die?

09:32.510 --> 09:34.850
It's all you can think about.

09:36.060 --> 09:38.720
I try not to dwell on it.

09:39.850 --> 09:42.270
If I pictured how I'm going to die,

09:42.770 --> 09:45.690
I probably wouldn't be able to fight.

09:47.360 --> 09:48.480
Yeah.

09:49.740 --> 09:51.150
You're right.

09:56.580 --> 09:58.580
How long will I stay alive?

09:59.830 --> 10:02.490
You're alive now, aren't you?

10:03.540 --> 10:05.060
For now.

10:05.710 --> 10:07.800
Isn't that a good thing?

10:07.800 --> 10:09.300
You're alive!

10:10.510 --> 10:13.460
Can you say that in front of 
the bodies of those who aren't?

10:21.230 --> 10:24.450
I might not be able 
to go home anymore...

10:28.450 --> 10:29.750
We're almost done.

10:30.180 --> 10:32.780
There were about five 
dead we couldn't recover.

10:33.760 --> 10:35.190
Not even a part of them?

10:35.710 --> 10:38.580
They're the only ones we 
couldn't due to the Titans...

10:40.130 --> 10:43.780
It's probably best for the families 
that we not bring those back.

10:45.300 --> 10:46.980
Say they're MIA.

10:46.980 --> 10:47.770
Yes, sir.

10:49.100 --> 10:53.040
We saw several Titans near the forest,

10:53.040 --> 10:55.460
but none are headed this way as of yet.

10:56.100 --> 10:57.460
We're moving out now.

10:57.800 --> 10:59.290
Tell all the squads.

10:59.290 --> 11:00.350
Yes, sir.

11:00.350 --> 11:02.960
I cannot accept this, Commander Erwin!

11:02.960 --> 11:04.810
Hey, you...

11:05.060 --> 11:06.710
We should recover them!

11:06.710 --> 11:09.820
Ivan's body was right in front of us!

11:09.820 --> 11:12.280
There was a Titan right next to him...

11:12.280 --> 11:14.110
It could result in another casualty!

11:14.380 --> 11:17.310
If they attack, we can just defeat them!

11:17.820 --> 11:20.560
Ivan's an old friend. 
We're from the same town.

11:20.560 --> 11:22.280
I know his parents.

11:22.570 --> 11:24.850
If nothing else, I'd 
like to bring him home!

11:24.850 --> 11:26.170
Don't be selfish!

11:26.170 --> 11:27.680
Squabbling kids?

11:28.550 --> 11:29.760
Captain Levi...

11:30.400 --> 11:33.420
If you confirmed he's 
dead, that's enough.

11:34.090 --> 11:36.870
Whether you have the body, dead is dead.

11:37.290 --> 11:39.230
It won't change anything.

11:40.040 --> 11:41.130
No...

11:41.940 --> 11:44.430
We'll say Ivan and the 
others went missing.

11:44.860 --> 11:46.330
That's my final decision.

11:46.330 --> 11:47.380
Give it up.

11:50.580 --> 11:51.860
Don't the two of you

11:52.420 --> 11:55.840
have any human feelings at all?!

11:55.840 --> 11:58.360
Hey, Dieter... You're going too far!

12:08.950 --> 12:13.960
<b>Information We Can Share So Far:</b>

12:08.950 --> 12:13.960
<b>Survey Corps Wagons (1) 
These wagons include a complicated suspension system 
of ultra-hard steel that can only be made in factory cities.</b>

12:13.960 --> 12:18.960
<b>Information We Can Share So Far:</b>

12:13.960 --> 12:18.960
<b>Survey Corps Wagons (2) 
Wagons hitched to Survey Corps horses travel 
around 20 km/h. They can maintain their speed 
on various terrain, be it paved or unpaved road.</b>

12:43.510 --> 12:44.570
Titans!

12:52.340 --> 12:53.210
That's...

12:55.230 --> 12:56.460
Dieter!

13:00.330 --> 13:01.540
That fool...

13:05.100 --> 13:06.720
The rear line has sighted Titans!

13:07.890 --> 13:09.220
Onward at full speed!

13:09.710 --> 13:12.730
I don't see any tall trees or buildings.

13:13.480 --> 13:15.440
Fighting out here will be difficult.

13:15.900 --> 13:18.000
We're better off outrunning 
them till we reach the walls.

13:44.660 --> 13:46.370
They're going to catch us!

13:46.650 --> 13:48.390
Do we have to fight?

13:48.920 --> 13:51.380
Maneuver Gear has limited 
utility in open areas!

13:51.850 --> 13:52.810
And look...

13:53.640 --> 13:54.680
They just keep coming!

13:55.590 --> 13:58.400
Then what do we do?

14:01.140 --> 14:02.230
We...

14:38.470 --> 14:40.060
No! They'll reach us!

14:40.180 --> 14:41.910
I'll get behind them!

14:41.910 --> 14:43.530
I'll draw their attention, then you—

14:43.530 --> 14:44.570
No.

14:45.150 --> 14:46.700
Just abandon the bodies.

14:47.070 --> 14:48.110
They'll reach us.

14:48.740 --> 14:50.070
B-But...

14:50.570 --> 14:53.910
In the past, many bodies 
haven't made it back.

14:54.540 --> 14:56.750
These guys aren't anything special.

14:58.080 --> 14:59.290
Are we doing this?

15:00.000 --> 15:01.580
Are we really doing it?!

15:06.170 --> 15:07.340
Damn it...

15:09.880 --> 15:11.590
We have to!

15:40.790 --> 15:42.120
Okay!

15:42.560 --> 15:44.410
Keep going!

15:56.230 --> 15:59.070
As soon as we know where 
we are, we will depart.

15:59.070 --> 16:00.640
Stay alert!

16:01.030 --> 16:03.650
We'll have to slightly alter 
our route to the east...

16:12.200 --> 16:13.660
Captain Levi...

16:14.610 --> 16:15.730
I...

16:19.380 --> 16:21.540
This proves that they were alive.

16:23.170 --> 16:24.560
To me, at least.

16:29.300 --> 16:30.600
This was Ivan's.

16:36.700 --> 16:37.840
Captain...

16:55.070 --> 16:56.690
We're leaving!

17:15.960 --> 17:19.050
Eren, you should stop 
considering the Survey Corps.

17:20.010 --> 17:23.300
What? You're going to tell 
me they're stupid, too?

17:23.680 --> 17:26.220
That isn't it...

17:33.150 --> 17:35.450
The Survey Corps is back!

17:35.650 --> 17:37.390
The front gate's opening!

17:37.390 --> 17:38.400
Let's go, Mikasa!

17:38.400 --> 17:39.860
The heroes are back!

17:59.460 --> 18:01.840
These are all that made it back?

18:02.420 --> 18:04.750
Everyone else must've been eaten.

18:05.140 --> 18:08.080
That's what happens when 
you go outside the walls.

18:08.680 --> 18:13.190
It's like our taxes all 
go to fatten them up.

18:13.900 --> 18:14.440
Eren?

18:19.650 --> 18:21.080
What's wrong?

18:29.570 --> 18:30.500
Eren...

18:36.360 --> 18:37.380
Eren!

18:46.390 --> 18:47.300
Eren...

18:53.850 --> 18:55.440
You shouldn't get up.

18:56.520 --> 18:57.690
Rest.

18:58.980 --> 19:00.200
The Female Titan?

19:01.650 --> 19:02.700
It got away.

19:03.700 --> 19:04.740
Why?

19:05.400 --> 19:07.780
What about the others?

19:08.810 --> 19:10.210
What about the plan?

19:11.080 --> 19:12.290
It failed...

19:13.080 --> 19:14.450
Rest for the time being.

19:17.290 --> 19:18.350
What is this?

19:19.720 --> 19:22.720
Did you save me again?

19:26.550 --> 19:29.230
We're almost to the walls.

19:47.340 --> 19:49.910
Aren't there fewer than 
there were this morning?

19:49.910 --> 19:51.240
Man...

19:51.240 --> 19:53.040
Far fewer...

19:53.620 --> 19:55.540
Another disaster.

19:56.920 --> 20:01.010
Just this morning, they left raising a ruckus, 
but they're already back?

20:01.010 --> 20:02.930
What was the point?

20:03.260 --> 20:04.500
Who knows?

20:05.380 --> 20:09.180
But judging by the gloomy expressions,

20:09.720 --> 20:13.510
they managed to waste more 
of our taxes, if nothing else.

20:16.730 --> 20:18.820
Eren, just bear with it.

20:29.990 --> 20:31.570
So cool!

20:31.570 --> 20:33.490
The Survey Corps is so awesome!

20:34.120 --> 20:37.180
They got the crap kicked out 
of them, and they still fight!

20:57.600 --> 20:58.820
Captain Levi!

20:59.600 --> 21:01.360
My daughter is in your squad...

21:01.810 --> 21:03.240
I'm Petra's father.

21:03.600 --> 21:06.200
Before she sees me, I 
wanted to talk to you.

21:07.280 --> 21:10.240
She sent me this letter...

21:10.240 --> 21:13.590
She mentioned that you respected her 
abilities enough to let her join your squad.

21:13.990 --> 21:17.000
That she was going to devote herself to you.

21:17.160 --> 21:21.790
Well, I guess she's too starry-eyed 
to consider how her father feels!

21:23.540 --> 21:27.090
Well, as her father,

21:27.630 --> 21:30.880
I think it's too early for her to marry.

21:30.880 --> 21:34.850
She's still so young, with 
so much to experience...

21:34.960 --> 21:37.680
Commander Erwin! Answer us!

21:38.060 --> 21:41.860
Did this expedition learn enough 
to justify the number of dead?

21:42.100 --> 21:45.300
Do you think the dead have no regrets?

21:48.820 --> 21:53.680
The expenses and casualties from 
the expedition were more than enough

21:53.680 --> 21:57.880
to discredit the faction that had 
supported the Survey Corps.

22:07.910 --> 22:12.670
As those responsible, including Erwin, 
were summoned to the capital,

22:14.010 --> 22:16.490
it was decided that Eren 
was to be handed over.

23:53.330 --> 23:54.710
That day, Annie was part

23:54.710 --> 23:58.640
of the escort guard for Eren and the others, 
as they answered a summons to the capital.

23:59.070 --> 24:02.110
Suddenly, Armin appeared,

24:02.110 --> 24:06.160
and asked Annie to assist with 
a highly sensitive mission.

24:04.960 --> 24:08.060
Smile 
Raid on Stohess District (1)
